{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>Because he burned the bones of the king of Edom into lime</b> — a way of disgrace, and he [the king] is of the children of Isaac. And some say: on account of the matter of 'and he offered him up as a burnt offering' and afterward burned him, or then he burned him."], :book :amos, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 2, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Amos -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/amos"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:17:43.886310588Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}